// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO4-7/35-38 - dedicated motor-driver output
// channels (X1-4/Y1-4 connectors), not general-purpose.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO0 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard "GPIO0 Button"
// (shorts GPIO0 to GND via R5/switch) per vendor schematic
// (github.com/yellobyte/YB-ESP32-S3-DRV doc/YB-ESP32-S3-DRV_schematic_1_2.jpg).
// GPIO47 tagged "led_high" - confirmed onboard "Status LED (GPIO47)"
// (anode to GPIO47, cathode via R6 to GND = active-high) per same schematic.
